<task id="011" project="spaarke-modal-system">
  <metadata>
    <title>ADR-050: Canonical Modal Shell — FR-10</title>
    <phase>0 Build</phase>
    <gate>blocked until 004</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>New file creation (ADR) with project constraints; no code, no quality gate at Step 9.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Concise ADR authoring from a settled owner decision (spec §11-C); constraints already enumerated in spec/design.</model-tier-reason>
