  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`.claude/adr/ADR-050-canonical-modal-shell.md` exists with explicit MUST and MUST NOT sections covering: compose primitives, Fluent `Dialog` envelope, scaled-theme `--sprk-ui-scale`, semantic tokens only, native thin scrollbar (MUST); hand-rolled overlays, CSS zoom, per-surface bespoke chrome (MUST NOT).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The ADR references ADR-021 (strengthened) and ADR-023 (preserved) and does not contradict either.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`.claude/adr/INDEX.md` has a new ADR-050 row with title, key constraint, and status; the number does not collide with an existing ADR.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No source code is modified (documentation only); both writes are under `.claude/` and were made in the main session.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Design §7 deliverable #4 + spec §11-C. Concise-ADR examples to mirror: any recent row's file in `.claude/adr/` (e.g. ADR-030/ADR-032). CLAUDE.md §18 requires a `.claude/CHANGELOG.md` entry for `.claude/` changes — task 013 owns the consolidated CHANGELOG entry for the FR-10 doc/ADR/pattern set, so coordinate rather than double-entering. Completion summary appended here when done.</notes>

